- Poslušaj me!

780
00:52:40.916 --> 00:52:44.250
Nosit ću te. samo uđi u vodu.

781
00:52:47.000 --> 00:52:49.250
Idite zajedno.

782
00:52:49.333 --> 00:52:51.166
- Jedan po jedan.
- Ne...

783
00:52:51.708 --> 00:52:52.541
Adrienne!

784
00:52:57.083 --> 00:52:58.625
Idem.

785
00:52:58.708 --> 00:52:59.541
Idem.

786
00:53:00.333 --> 00:53:04.083
Blizu je! Ne mogu dokučiti! Adrienne!

787
00:53:04.750 --> 00:53:07.125
Hoćeš li me uhvatiti? Adrienne!

788
00:53:07.208 --> 00:53:09.000
- Gledaj!
- Ne.

789
00:53:10.083 --> 00:53:10.916
