794
00:53:23.791 --> 00:53:25.875
Ne. Adrienne!

795
00:53:29.333 --> 00:53:30.666
Bože!

796
00:53:31.166 --> 00:53:32.500
U pomoć!

797
00:53:33.000 --> 00:53:34.791
U pomoć!

798
00:53:45.625 --> 00:53:46.875
Ovo je totalno ludo.

799
00:53:49.833 --> 00:53:53.250
