- Umrla bi s njom.

804
00:54:40.958 --> 00:54:43.208
Moramo ići odavde. stijene se ruše.

805
00:54:45.125 --> 00:54:46.000
Izlaz u ocean.

806
00:54:47.708 --> 00:54:48.916
