- Dalje!

930
01:09:40.791 --> 01:09:41.707
Volim te.

931
01:09:46.500 --> 01:09:47.500
Plivaj dalje.

932
01:09:52.166 --> 01:09:53.832
Ne!

933
01:10:25.416 --> 01:10:26.375
Sara!

934
01:10:27.833 --> 01:10:29.625
Ne!

935
01:10:30.291 --> 01:10:33.166
- Ne.
- Moramo plivati dalje.

936
01:10:33.250 --> 01:10:35.375
Ne. on je tamo.

937
01:10:35.458 --> 01:10:37.500
- Moramo plivati.
- Ne.

938
01:10:38.916 --> 01:10:39.833
Ne mogu.

939
01:10:41.750 --> 01:10:43.416
- Zajedno.
- Ne!

940
01:10:45.000 --> 01:10:46.791
- Moramo.
- Ali ja ne želim.

941
01:10:47.375 --> 01:10:50.083
Uspjet ćemo. Jedan...

942
01:10:51.208 --> 01:10:52.041
